
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant R as Research
    participant A as Analyzer
    participant Cr as Critic
    participant W as Writer
    participant S as Shared State

    User->>C: Submit user query
    C->>S: Store user query
    C->>R: Forward request

    R->>S: Store research findings
    R->>A: Send research data

    A->>S: Store analysis
    A->>Cr: Submit analysis

    Cr->>S: Store feedback and approval

    alt Analysis approved
        Cr->>W: Send approved analysis
        W->>S: Store final answer
        W-->>User: Return final response
    else Analysis rejected
        Cr->>A: Request retry if allowed
    else Empty analysis or retry limit reached
        Cr-->>User: Workflow stops
    end
